  "body": "On switching from one tailnet with Connectors 2025 enabled to another, clear the address assignments and flow tables from the previous tailnet. They will not be useful in the new one (since the tailnet configuration and nodes are different), and could blackhole traffic if both tailnets happen to have a connector for the same domain.\r\n\r\nFixes tailscale/corp#45619.",
